      "role": "user",
      "content": "I am currently preparing a lecture on the acoustic properties of transverse flutes and would like to ensure my explanation of the harmonic series is mathematically rigorous. Could you provide a detailed explanation of the relationship between the fundamental frequency (f₀) and the subsequent partials in the harmonic series, and specifically describe how the distribution of these overtones influences the spectral envelope and the resulting timbre of the instrument?",
